From dd5c01b2b37452b98e359d4de27cb2e1035a5106 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Bishow B." <bishowbhattarai4@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:58:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign with shared orange design system and IBM Plex

- Add styles/design-system.css: one shared token file (colors, type,
  spacing, radii) used by both the portfolio and the blog
- Orange accent (#FF6A1F), neutral greys with visible card borders
  and three clear text levels, all text >= 4.5:1 contrast
- One typeface family: IBM Plex Sans + IBM Plex Mono, self-hosted via
  @fontsource (replaces Space Grotesk, Plus Jakarta, League Spartan,
  Instrument Serif)
- Tailwind colors now read the CSS variables; hard-coded hex classes
  removed from components

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K5EpeqMu9732KzaELbzRcC
